# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository and the working tree.
#
# Upstream (GentlemanHu/Tabby-MCP) stores every file as LF -- including
# scripts/install.ps1 -- so no per-extension overrides are needed.
#
# This repo had drifted to CRLF in 25 tracked files, which made every diff
# against upstream look like a full-file rewrite.
* text=auto eol=lf
